# CoE5SE's own Mod Settings. CoE5SE reads this file right after CoE5SE.c5m.

newsetting auto_approve
onoff
default 1
label "Approve new and changed DLLs automatically"
tip "Off: each new or changed DLL waits for approval, asked at startup or given here. Takes effect next launch."

newsetting script_log
onoff
default 0
label "Enable copious logs"
tip "Mods' own lines in coe5mod.log too. For a mod author's bug report."

newsettingheader "Mac only"

newsetting mac_workshop_list
onoff
default 1
restart
label "List subscribed Workshop mods on the Mods screen"
tip "Mac only. CoE5SE lists Workshop mods for the game, which can't ask Steam. Off: only mods in ~/.coe5/mods."
